{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KqrmPb8yMvGwLUGyNSDDu2","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Taiwan news today November 10 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Taiwan News\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_News\"},{\"title\":\"Front Page - Taipei Times\",\"url\":\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan News - Voice of the People, Bridge to the World\",\"url\":\"https://www.taiwannews.com.tw/\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan Journal\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Journal\"},{\"title\":\"TVBS News\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TVBS_News\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan Daily\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Daily\"},{\"title\":\"TaiwanPlus\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TaiwanPlus\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan News\",\"url\":\"https://www.newsnow.co.uk/h/World+News/Asia/Taiwan\"},{\"title\":\"Focus Taiwan - CNA English News\",\"url\":\"https://focustaiwan.tw/\"}]\n\nHere's what the search turned up. The results are mixed in recency, so I've noted dates where they're given.\n\n- **Focus Taiwan (CNA), the most recent listing:** Headlines include the arrival of a second batch of F-16V jets, a live-fire drill in Kinmen, and Lai's push for independent satellite launches. Taiwan Railway shortened its online ticket booking cutoff to 5 minutes, and National Taiwan University remains 23rd in 2027 QS Asia rankings.\n- **Taiwan News:** Recent stories cover a magnitude 4.2 earthquake in central Taiwan, a new rule that bars Chinese-owned yachts under revised entry rules, and a report that China's 'anaconda' strategy targets Taiwan's outlying islands.\n- **Taipei Times front page (dated early November):** Markets were a major story. On November 6, Taiwan ordered its financial regulator to stabilize the stock market after a broad sell-off, and Shares in TSMC plummeted as much as 9.8 percent. Also on November 6, prosecutors indicted independent Legislator May Chin and three of her aides over alleged Chinese funding. A November 9 item says an investigation into Nvidia's CEO is unlikely to have a major impact on Taiwan's AI supply chain, according to a think tank.\n\nI couldn't find a dedicated November 10, 2026 roundup, so these are the most recent items available, and the earthquake and sell-off stories may not be from today. The Focus Taiwan and Taiwan News homepages are the best places to check for same-day updates.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bc62ff48-ed56-4bc2-a396-83f7a509ebf6","uuid":"9c9c9735-5649-4fcb-a28e-ddf32d581461","timestamp":"2026-11-10T03:00:30.423Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Taiwan news today November 10 2026","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01MTSe3TGpmr6UaH9Le7GjFz","content":[{"title":"Taiwan News","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_News"},{"title":"Front Page - Taipei Times","url":"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front"},{"title":"Taiwan News - Voice of the People, Bridge to the World","url":"https://www.taiwannews.com.tw/"},{"title":"Taiwan Journal","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Journal"},{"title":"TVBS News","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TVBS_News"},{"title":"Taiwan Daily","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Daily"},{"title":"TaiwanPlus","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TaiwanPlus"},{"title":"Taiwan News","url":"https://www.newsnow.co.uk/h/World+News/Asia/Taiwan"},{"title":"Focus Taiwan - CNA English News","url":"https://focustaiwan.tw/"}]},"Here's what the search turned up. The results are mixed in recency, so I've noted dates where they're given.\n\n- **Focus Taiwan (CNA), the most recent listing:** Headlines include the arrival of a second batch of F-16V jets, a live-fire drill in Kinmen, and Lai's push for independent satellite launches. Taiwan Railway shortened its online ticket booking cutoff to 5 minutes, and National 